        <briefdescription>
<para>Enter Draining. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase 1 — DRAINING.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Exception safety: noexcept.</para>
</simplesect>
Closes the acceptor (caller&apos;s responsibility before calling <ref refid="classthemis_1_1server_1_1_http_shutdown_manager_1ad069e842ca516fc3860bf2d73d153287" kindref="member">run()</ref>) and polls in-flight requests until the drain deadline expires or all requests complete.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="post"><para>phase_ == kForceClose (or kDraining was skipped when drain_timeout_ms_==0). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
