<para>Enter Force Close. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase 2 — FORCE_CLOSE.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Exception safety: noexcept.</para>
</simplesect>
Invokes the optional force_close_sessions_ callback to hard-cancel any sessions that survived the drain phase. Waits up to force_close_timeout_ms_ for the in-flight count to reach zero. </para>
